    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;City Winery Philadelphia presents Dendê and Band live on Sunday, November 16th at 7:30pm. Dendê is a percussionist, singer, composer, bandleader, teacher, and multi-instrumentalist. He’s been a professional musician since the age of 14, when he appeared in the frontline of Timbalada, Carlinhos Brown’s superstar percussion ensemble. Since 2001, he’s been splitting his time between the&nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;read-more&quot; href=&quot;https://www.mamadele.com/new/event/dende-and-band-at-city-winery/&quot;&gt;Continue reading&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
